"明るさをもとに、1 色で染める（カラー）か、パレットの色に置き換える（パレット）" = "Tints by brightness with one color (Color) or maps to palette colors (Palette)";
"黒と白の位置・ガンマで明るさとコントラストを整える" = "Adjusts brightness and contrast with the black and white points and gamma";
"ネガのように色を反転する。明るさだけ（色はそのまま）・色だけ（明るさはそのまま）も選べる。不透明度を動かすと元の絵と行き来する" = "Inverts colors like a negative. Can also invert only brightness (keeping color) or only color (keeping brightness). Animate the opacity to go back and forth with the original";
"色の段数を減らす。ディザとドットを足すと GIF アニメのような見た目に" = "Reduces the number of color levels. Add dither and dots for an animated-GIF look";
"1 色で塗りつぶす。マスク用の白や、色を重ねるのに" = "Fills with one color. Useful as white for masks, or to layer a color";
"パレットの色でグラデーション（直線・円・回転）。速さで流れる" = "Gradient of palette colors (linear, circle, rotation). Flows with speed";
"しま模様。角度・太さ・速さで動かせる（すき間は透明）" = "Stripes. Animate with angle, thickness and speed (gaps are transparent)";
"チェッカー・格子・ドット（すき間は透明）" = "Checker, grid or dots (gaps are transparent)";
"なめらかに動くノイズか、砂嵐" = "Smoothly moving noise, or TV static";
"円・リング・四角・枠・三角。数を増やすと並ぶ（まわりは透明）" = "Circle, ring, square, frame, triangle. Raise the count to tile them (the surroundings are transparent)";
"やわらかい光の帯がゆったりうねって流れる。ふちが虹色ににじみ、まわりにぼんやりした光とフィルムのざらつき（まわりは透明）" = "Soft bands of light slowly undulate and flow. The edges bleed into rainbow colors, with a hazy glow and film grain around them (the surroundings are transparent)";
"粘菌の動き方をまねた、何十万もの点。自分や仲間の通った跡のにおいを追って進むだけで、葉脈・神経・川の地図のような網を自分で作っては組み替える。えさを置くと、えさどうしを網でつなぐ（まわりは透明）" = "Hundreds of thousands of points that imitate slime mold. Just by following the scent of their own and others' trails, they build networks like leaf veins, nerves or river maps, and keep rearranging them. Place food and the network connects the food (the surroundings are transparent)";
"色ごとに「あの色に寄る・あの色から逃げる」を決めただけの粒から、細胞のように集まる・追いかける・回る「生き物」が生まれる。たねで性格が変わり、拍ごとに入れ替えられる（まわりは透明）" = "Particles that only know which colors to approach or avoid give rise to “creatures” that gather like cells, chase and orbit. The seed changes their character, which can reshuffle on the beat (the surroundings are transparent)";
"ばらばらに光るホタルが、見えるまわりの光に少しずつ合わせて、やがて全体がそろって光る（蔵本モデル）。そろう強さを動かすと、ばらばら ↔ 一斉を行き来する。拍に合わせることもできる（まわりは透明）" = "Fireflies blinking at random gradually match the light they can see, until the whole field flashes together (Kuramoto model). Animate the sync strength to go between random and unison. Can also follow the beat (the surroundings are transparent)";
"簡単な式をくり返すだけで点が描く、煙や絹のような形（クリフォード・デ・ヨング。トーマス・アイザワは 3D で回る）。係数をゆっくり揺らして形を変え続け、点の重なりを光の濃さで描く（まわりは透明）" = "Smoke- or silk-like forms drawn by points repeating a simple formula (Clifford, De Jong; Thomas and Aizawa rotate in 3D). The coefficients sway slowly to keep the shape changing, and overlaps are drawn as light density (the surroundings are transparent)";
"場所ごとに少し前のコマを見せる。上ほど過去にすると、動く人が飴のように伸びる・ねじれる（スリットスキャン）。円・ノイズ・明るさでずらし方を変えられる" = "Shows earlier frames in different places. With the past toward the top, moving people stretch and twist like taffy (slit scan). Circle, noise or brightness change how it's offset";
"絵の動き（明るさが変わった所）が、本物の流体の計算で絵の具を押し流す。煙やインクのように渦を巻いて混ざり、残る。風で、止まった絵でも流れる" = "Motion in the image (where brightness changes) pushes paint around with a real fluid simulation. It swirls and mixes like smoke or ink, and lingers. With wind, even a still image flows";
"サーキットベンドしたアナログ映像機材のように絵を乱す。同期が外れて横に裂ける・縦に流れる・帯ごと跳ねる、色が遅れてにじむ、ゲインの入れすぎで明るい所が飽和して反転する、輪郭が二重に光る、色が虹色にうなる、砂嵐。FX パッドに入れて押している間だけ乱すのも合う" = "Disrupts the image like circuit-bent analog video gear: sync loss tears it sideways, rolls it vertically and makes bands jump; color lags and bleeds; too much gain saturates and inverts the brights; edges glow double; colors oscillate into rainbows; static. Works well on an FX pad, disrupting only while held";
"古いビデオテープの再生のように。トラッキングのノイズの帯が流れ、画面の下がずれてざらつき、絵がゆらゆら揺れ、色がにじんで色あせ、白い線（ドロップアウト）が走る" = "Like playing an old videotape: tracking noise bands roll by, the bottom of the screen shifts and gets grainy, the image wobbles, colors bleed and fade, and white lines (dropouts) streak across";
"カメラで、それを映しているモニターを撮ったように、前のコマを拡大・回転・色相ずれさせて重ね続ける。画面の中に画面が無限に続き、渦やトンネルが生まれる。暗い所を切り抜くと、そこから前の絵が見える" = "Like filming a monitor that shows its own camera: keeps layering the previous frame zoomed, rotated and hue-shifted. Screens within screens go on forever, forming swirls and tunnels. Keying out dark areas shows the previous image through them";
"70 年代の映像シンセ（Rutt/Etra）のように、絵を横の走査線に分けて、明るい所ほど線を持ち上げる。映像が波打つ線の地形になる（まわりは透明）" = "Like a 70s video synthesizer (Rutt/Etra): splits the image into horizontal scanlines and lifts the lines where it's brighter. The video becomes a terrain of wavy lines (the surroundings are transparent)";
"昔のブラウン管モニターに映したように。走査線・蛍光体の RGB の粒・画面のふくらみ・にじむ光・明るいものが尾を引く残光・まわりの暗さ。ほかのエフェクトの最後にかけると全体がモニターに映る" = "Like showing it on an old CRT monitor: scanlines, RGB phosphor grain, screen curvature, glow, afterglow trailing bright things, and darker edges. Put it last after other effects to put the whole thing on a monitor";
"音（上部の「音の入力」）の、周波数ごとの大きさ（スペクトラム）と波形を、そのまま絵にする。棒・線・波形・円（棒）・円（波形）（まわりは透明）" = "Draws the sound (from “Audio Input” in the top bar) directly: the level per frequency (spectrum) and the waveform. Bars, line, waveform, circle (bars), circle (waveform) (the surroundings are transparent)";
"同じネットワークの別の Mac・PC（TouchDesigner・Resolume・OBS など）が NDI で出している映像を、クリップとして置く。映像の選び方はこの欄の下。NDI ランタイム（NDI Tools）が要る" = "Places video sent over NDI by another Mac or PC on the same network (TouchDesigner, Resolume, OBS, etc.) as a clip. Choose the video below. Requires the NDI runtime (NDI Tools)";
"Web カメラ・HDMI キャプチャ・iPhone（連係カメラ）の映像を、クリップとして置く。カメラの選び方はこの欄の下" = "Places video from a webcam, HDMI capture or iPhone (Continuity Camera) as a clip. Choose the camera below";
"ほかのアプリ（TouchDesigner など）が Syphon で出している映像を、クリップとして置く。映像の選び方はこの欄の下（透明はそのまま）" = "Places video sent over Syphon by another app (TouchDesigner, etc.) as a clip. Choose the video below (transparency is kept)";
"奥へ奥へと進んでいくトンネル。輪・格子・チェッカー・光の筋・もやの模様で、形は円・四角・六角・三角。回す・ねじる・うねって曲がる。奥は暗くなって透ける（まわりは透明）" = "A tunnel that keeps going deeper. Patterns: rings, grid, checker, light rays, haze; shapes: circle, square, hexagon, triangle. Rotate, twist, or bend it. The depths darken into transparency (the surroundings are transparent)";
"水の中・熱気・渦のように、絵をぬるぬるとゆがませる。ねばりを上げると、ゆがみがゆがみを呼んで生き物のような模様に。色のずれでふちが虹色ににじむ" = "Distorts the image like water, heat haze or swirls. Raise the viscosity and distortion feeds on distortion into living patterns. Color fringing bleeds the edges into rainbow colors";
"イワシやムクドリのような群れ。1 匹ずつが、まわりに寄る・向きをそろえる・ぶつからないように間をあける、だけで動き、群れ全体がうねって形を変える。天敵から逃げると群れが割れてまた集まる。厚みで 3D になり、回るカメラから見る（まわりは透明）" = "A flock like sardines or starlings. Each one only moves toward its neighbors, aligns with them, and keeps its distance, and the whole flock undulates and changes shape. Fleeing from predators splits the flock, which then regroups. Thickness makes it 3D, seen from an orbiting camera (the surroundings are transparent)";
"並べた粒（ラインの粒版）。形・並び・ばらつき・明滅、波で大きさが波打ち、奥への傾き・波の高さで 3D の点の雲になる。ふらふらで粒が自由に飛び回り、光のにじみで光る（ほたるのように。すき間は透明）" = "Rows of particles (the particle version of Lines). Shape, layout, jitter, twinkle; waves ripple their size, and tilt and wave height turn them into a 3D point cloud. Wander lets them fly freely, and glow makes them shine (like fireflies; gaps are transparent)";
"等間隔の線（Arena の Lines のように）。本数は画面の高さに入る数、0° で縦の線。波で波形のようにうねり、奥への傾きで 3D の床・壁のようになる（すき間は透明）" = "Evenly spaced lines (like Lines in Arena). The count is how many fit the screen height; 0° makes vertical lines. Waves make them undulate like a waveform, and tilt makes them a 3D floor or wall (gaps are transparent)";
"ひまわりの種のように、粒が黄金角（137.5°）ずつ回りながら中心から生まれて外へ広がる。線の長さで棒に、色のばらつきでカラフルに（まわりは透明）" = "Like sunflower seeds, particles are born at the center and spread outward, each turning by the golden angle (137.5°). Line length turns them into sticks, color variation makes them colorful (the surroundings are transparent)";
"今の時刻・決めた時刻までのカウントダウン・タイマー・ストップウォッチを出す。0 になったら好きな文字を出せる（まわりは透明）" = "Shows the current time, a countdown to a set time, a timer, or a stopwatch. Can show any text at 0 (the surroundings are transparent)";
"文字を出す。流す・敷き詰める・1 文字ずつ・拍で弾む。行ごとに拍で切り替えも（まわりは透明）" = "Shows text. Scroll, tile, one character at a time, or bounce on the beat. Lines can also switch on the beat (the surroundings are transparent)";
"四角・丸の形で切り抜く（外は透明）。位置や大きさを動かせる。反転すると中を隠す" = "Cuts out with a square or round shape (outside is transparent). Position and size can be animated. Invert to hide the inside";
"プレビューの上で点を置いて描いた形で切り抜く。建物や物に合わせるのに" = "Cuts out with a shape drawn by placing points on the preview. For fitting buildings or objects";
"動いた跡が残像になって残る。レイヤーかコンポジションにかけると、位置や回転の動きも跡になる" = "Motion leaves trails. On a layer or the composition, position and rotation movements leave trails too";
"BPM か秒に合わせて点滅させる（色で光る・消える・反転）。残光を上げると光ったあとすっと消える" = "Flashes on the BPM or in seconds (flash a color, disappear, invert). Raise the afterglow for a quick fade after each flash";
"コマを間引いて、指定したフレームレートでしか動かないようにする（この段全体にかかる）" = "Drops frames so it only moves at the given frame rate (applies to this whole stage)";
"このレイヤーを透明なガラスにして、明るさの坂で下の絵を曲げて見せる。文字や図形が、映像の上を透明なまま流れる" = "Turns this layer into clear glass that bends the image below along its brightness slopes. Text and shapes flow over the video while staying transparent";
"このレイヤーを光にして、下の絵を照らす。照らされていない所は暗く沈み、光はぼんやり広がる" = "Turns this layer into light that illuminates the image below. Unlit areas sink into darkness, and the light spreads softly";
"このレイヤーの動き（または明るさ）で、下の絵を絵の具のように押し流してかき混ぜる。だんだん元の絵に戻る" = "This layer's motion (or brightness) pushes and stirs the image below like paint. It gradually returns to the original";
"2 つの絵の明るさを波として重ね、ずれた所に動く縞（モアレ）を出す" = "Overlays the brightness of two images as waves, creating moving stripes (moiré) where they differ";
"下の絵の明るさ（形）に、このレイヤーの色を借りて塗る。このレイヤーをパレットとして使うこともできる" = "Paints the brightness (shapes) of the image below with this layer's colors. This layer can also be used as a palette";
"下の絵の暗い所（または明るい所・ノイズ）から順に、このレイヤーへ溶けていく。ふちは燃えるように光る" = "Dissolves into this layer starting from the dark areas (or bright areas, or noise) of the image below. The edges glow as if burning";
"（内部用）" = "(internal)";
"下のレイヤーに加算して 100% を超えた分を、にじみ（ハレーション）・色相ずれ・波紋に変える" = "Adds onto the layers below and turns everything above 100% into bleed (halation), hue shift and ripples";
"色・グラデーション" = "Color / Gradient";
"線・模様" = "Lines / Patterns";
"図形・粒" = "Shapes / Particles";
"光・空間" = "Light / Space";
"文字・ロゴ・時計" = "Text / Logo / Clock";
"ほかのアプリ・カメラから" = "From Other Apps / Cameras";
"光・ぼかし" = "Light / Blur";
"グリッチ・デジタル" = "Glitch / Digital";
"マスク" = "Mask";
"時間" = "Time";
"アナログ機材" = "Analog Gear";
"合成" = "Blend";
"ほたる" = "Fireflies";
"ばらばらの小さな光が、ふらふら自由に飛び回り、ゆっくり明滅する（黄緑の光）" = "Scattered small lights fly freely and blink slowly (yellow-green light)";
"舞う粒" = "Floating Dust";
"細かい粒が少し上へ流れながら、ふわふわ漂う（ほこり・雪のように）" = "Fine particles drift softly while flowing slightly upward (like dust or snow)";
"まっすぐ並んだ粒（はじめの見た目）。波・3D はそのまま" = "Particles in straight rows (the initial look). Waves and 3D stay as they are";
"イワシ" = "Sardines";
"銀色の小魚の大きな群れ。向きを変えるとまとめてきらっと光り、天敵が来ると割れてまた集まる" = "A large school of small silver fish. They flash together when they turn, split when a predator comes, then regroup";
"ムクドリ" = "Starlings";
"小さな鳥の群れが空でうねる（羽ばたく。夕焼けの空の映像に重ねると合う）" = "A flock of small birds undulating in the sky (flapping; goes well over a sunset sky)";
"まとまらずに、思い思いに泳ぐ魚" = "Fish swimming as they please, without grouping";
"トルネード" = "Tornado";
"銀色の魚が、竜巻のように渦を巻いて回る（3D。下から見上げる）" = "Silver fish swirling like a tornado (3D, looking up from below)";
"ワープ" = "Warp";
"光の筋が奥から飛んでくる（宇宙をワープするように）" = "Streaks of light fly from the depths (like warping through space)";
"ネオン" = "Neon";
"パレットの色の輪が光りながら流れる、ゆるく曲がったトンネル" = "A gently curving tunnel with glowing rings of palette colors flowing by";
"格子の筒" = "Grid Tube";
"四角い格子の通路をまっすぐ進む（ワイヤーフレームのように）" = "Goes straight down a square grid passage (like a wireframe)";
"チェッカーがねじれながら回り、吸い込まれていく" = "A checker twists, rotates and gets sucked in";
"もやの洞窟" = "Hazy Cave";
"やわらかいもやが流れる、六角の洞窟" = "A hexagonal cave with soft haze flowing through";
"葉脈" = "Leaf Veins";
"葉脈のような網の目が、ゆっくり組み替わる（はじめの見た目）" = "A mesh like leaf veins slowly rearranges itself (the initial look)";
"細かい網" = "Fine Mesh";
"とても細かい網がびっしり（レースや神経のように）" = "A very fine mesh densely packed (like lace or nerves)";
"細胞" = "Cells";
"小さな丸い部屋がぎっしり並んで、泡や細胞のように" = "Small round chambers packed tightly, like bubbles or cells";
"太い川" = "Wide Rivers";
"太い流れがうねって、川の地図のように" = "Thick flows meander like a map of rivers";
"えさをつなぐ" = "Connect Food";
"動くえさの間を、網がつないでいく" = "The network connects the moving food";
"生き物" = "Creatures";
"細胞のようなかたまりが生まれて、追いかけ合う（はじめの見た目）" = "Cell-like clusters form and chase each other (the initial look)";
"光の跡" = "Light Trails";
"残像で、粒の通った道が光の線になる" = "Trails turn the particles' paths into lines of light";
"拍で変身" = "Beat Morph";
"4 拍ごとに性格が入れ替わり、群れの形ががらっと変わる" = "Their character reshuffles every 4 beats, dramatically changing the swarm's shape";
