"明るい所だけがふわっと光ってにじむ。しきい値より明るい所を取り出し、広くぼかして重ねる。色みを上げると、下の「色」の光になる" = "Only the bright areas glow softly and bleed. Takes what's brighter than the threshold, blurs it widely and adds it back. Raise the tint to make it glow in the “Color” below";
"絵を扇形に切って、鏡のように並べて回す。枚数・回る速さ・ズーム・取る所のずれで模様が変わる" = "Cuts the image into wedges and arranges them like mirrors, rotating. Segments, rotation speed, zoom and sample offset change the pattern";
"赤・緑・青を少しずつずらす。まっすぐ・放射（真ん中から外へ）・揺れる（ときどき帯ごと大きくずれる）。拍や音で動かすと気持ちいい" = "Shifts red, green and blue slightly apart. Straight, radial (from the center outward), or wobble (sometimes whole bands shift a lot). Feels good driven by the beat or sound";
"四角いモザイク、丸い点、印刷の網点（明るいほど大きな点）、横線（明るいほど太い線）" = "Square mosaic, round dots, print halftone (brighter = bigger dots), horizontal lines (brighter = thicker lines)";
"絵の輪郭だけを取り出して、ネオン管のように光らせる。色は元の色・1 色・虹色" = "Extracts only the edges of the image and makes them glow like neon tubes. Color: original, one color, or rainbow";
"中心から外へ流れるぼかし。スピード感。回るぼかしを足すと、渦を巻くように流れる" = "A blur streaking out from the center, for a sense of speed. Add spin blur to make it swirl";
"明るさがしきい値の間で続いている所（帯）ごとに、画素を明るさの順に並べ替えて、絵が縦や横に溶け流れる。流れる長さは、並べ替える帯のいちばん長いところ" = "For each run (band) where the brightness stays between the thresholds, sorts the pixels by brightness, so the image melts and streams vertically or horizontally. Streak length is the longest band sorted";
"動画の圧縮が壊れたときのように、動いた向きに前の絵を引きずって、絵が崩れて混ざる。拍で元に戻すと、崩れてはパッと戻る" = "Like broken video compression, drags the previous image along the motion so the picture crumbles and mixes. Reset on the beat to crumble and snap back";
"絵を文字に置き換える（明るい所ほど字が詰まる）。記号・ブロック・0 と 1・カタカナ" = "Replaces the image with characters (denser where it's brighter). Symbols, blocks, 0 and 1, katakana";
"色を 2〜8 色に減らして、点々で明るさを出す。白黒・昔のゲーム機の緑・4 色の昔のパソコン・元の色・パレット" = "Reduces to 2–8 colors and shows brightness with dots. Monochrome, retro handheld green, 4-color retro PC, original colors, palette";
"細胞の形のガラス片に割れて、片ごとに少しずつずれる。縁の線を太くするとステンドグラス風" = "Shatters into cell-shaped glass shards that each shift slightly. Thicker edge lines give a stained-glass look";
"2 つの薬が広がりながら反応して、珊瑚や迷路、斑点、指紋のような模様がじわじわ育つ。流れに乗って模様がずっと渦を巻いて動き、変わり続けるで場所ごとに育ち方が少しずつ変わって、ときどき消えてまた育つ。枯れるを上げると、育ってから寿命ほどたった所が暗くなって枯れ、空いた所へまたまわりから育って入ってくる（生まれては死ぬ波）。音のアタックで大きく乱れ、低音で速く育ち、音の大きさで光る（まわりは透明）" = "Two chemicals spread and react, slowly growing patterns like coral, mazes, spots or fingerprints. Flow keeps the pattern swirling, and Keep Changing varies the growth by area so it sometimes vanishes and regrows. Raise Wither and areas that have lived past their lifespan darken and die, and growth moves back into the gaps (waves of birth and death). Sound attack disturbs it, low end speeds growth, and loudness makes it glow (the surroundings are transparent)";
"ステージのレーザーのような光の線。扇形に振れたり回ったり。もやで光の筋が見える（まわりは透明）" = "Lines of light like stage lasers, sweeping in fans or rotating. Fog makes the beams visible (the surroundings are transparent)";
"80 年代風。光る格子の地面とワイヤーフレームの山を飛んでいく。夕日付き。色はパレット" = "80s style. Fly over a glowing grid floor and wireframe mountains, with a sunset. Colors come from the palette";
"画像やロゴ（透明付きの PNG がおすすめ）か文字を、光の粒にする。散らすを上げると粒が散って、下げると元の形に戻る（音で動かすと、音で散る）" = "Turns an image or logo (a PNG with transparency is recommended) or text into particles of light. Raise Scatter to scatter them, lower it to return to the original shape (drive it with sound to scatter on the sound)";
"溶けた球が、くっついたり離れたりしながら浮かぶ（ラバランプ）。まわりは透明" = "Molten blobs float, merging and separating (lava lamp). The surroundings are transparent";
"星が後ろへ流れていく宇宙の旅。速さを上げると筋になる（ハイパースペース）" = "A journey through space with stars streaming past. Raise the speed to turn them into streaks (hyperspace)";
"マンデルブロ・ジュリア・バーニングシップ集合に、ゆっくり潜り続ける（深くなったら戻ってくり返す）" = "Keeps slowly diving into the Mandelbrot, Julia or Burning Ship set (returns and repeats when it gets deep)";
"滴が落ちて、波紋が広がって重なる。拍で落とす・音で落とす・ときどき落とす" = "Drops fall and ripples spread and overlap. Drop on the beat, with sound, or now and then";
"枝分かれする稲妻が走る。拍や音のアタックで走らせる。まわりは透明" = "Branching lightning strikes. Trigger it with the beat or sound attack. The surroundings are transparent";
"回路図・木の枝・菌糸のような線が、画面いっぱいに伸びていき、古い線はだんだん消える。まわりは透明" = "Lines like circuit diagrams, tree branches or mycelium grow across the screen, and old lines gradually fade. The surroundings are transparent";
